#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:8
msgid "## Finding Open Source Software"
msgstr "## OSSを探す"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:9
msgid ""
"- Can existing OSS solve your problem?\n"
"- Where to search?\n"
"- [Approved Internal OSS Inventory](./using/oss-inventory.md) / Recommended OSS:\n"
"  - -> [Finding Open Source Software](./using/finding-oss.md)"
msgstr ""
"- 既存OSSで解決できないか\n"
"- どこから探すか\n"
"- [社内導入済みOSSリスト](./using/oss-inventory.md)／推奨OSS\n"
"  - → [OSSの探し方](./using/finding-oss.md)"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:10
msgid "## Evaluating Open Source Software"
msgstr "## OSSを評価する"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:11
msgid ""
"- Technical suitability\n"
"- High-level license compatibility\n"
"- Security vulnerabilities and maintenance health (commit frequency, responsiveness)\n"
"- Dependency trees (transitive dependencies)\n"
"  - -> [Evaluating Open Source Software](./using/evaluation.md)"
msgstr ""
"- 技術的に使えるか\n"
"- ライセンス的に問題ないか（ざっくり）\n"
"- 脆弱性と保守状況（更新頻度・対応姿勢）\n"
"- 依存関係（間接依存）\n"
"  - → [OSSの評価方法](./using/evaluation.md)"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:12
msgid "## Understanding Licensing Fundamentals"
msgstr "## ライセンスの基本を理解する"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:13
msgid ""
"- Open source comes with terms and conditions\n"
"- Differences between distribution, SaaS, and internal use\n"
"- Deployment models (Internal / Distribution / SaaS)\n"
"- Overview of open source license compliance:\n"
"  - -> [Open Source License Compliance](./compliance/license-compliance.md)\n"
"- What a license is:\n"
"  - -> [What Is a License?](./compliance/what-is-a-license.md)\n"
"- License categories and classifications:\n"
"  - -> [Types of Licenses](./compliance/license-types.md)"
msgstr ""
"- OSSには条件がある\n"
"- 配布・SaaS・社内利用の違い\n"
"- 利用形態（社内利用／配布／SaaS）\n"
"- ライセンスコンプライアンスの全体像\n"
"  - → [オープンソースライセンスコンプライアンス](./compliance/license-compliance.md)\n"
"- ライセンスとは何か\n"
"  - → [ライセンスとは](./compliance/what-is-a-license.md)\n"
"- ライセンスの種類と分類\n"
"  - → [ライセンスの種類](./compliance/license-types.md)"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:14
msgid "## Cases Requiring Care"
msgstr "## 注意が必要なケース"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:15
msgid ""
"- Scenarios triggering source disclosure obligations\n"
"- Scenarios requiring commercial licensing\n"
"- \"Looks like OSS, but isn't OSS\"\n"
"  - -> [Licenses with Source Code Disclosure Obligations](./compliance/source-disclosure-licenses.md) / [OSS with Commercial License Options](./compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md)"
msgstr ""
"- ソース公開義務が発生するケース\n"
"- 商用契約が必要になるケース\n"
"- \"OSSに見えるがOSSではない\"\n"
"- → [ソースコード提供義務のあるライセンス](./compliance/source-disclosure-licenses.md) / [商用ライセンスが選択できるOSS](./compliance/oss-with-commercial-license-options.md)"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:16
msgid "## Using Open Source in Engineering & Procurement"
msgstr "## 開発・調達でOSSを使う"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:17
msgid ""
"- In-house development\n"
"- Vendor deliverables\n"
"- Contracting requirements for outsourced or joint development (OSS disclosure lists, SBOMs, remediation SLAs)\n"
"- Logging utilized OSS metadata (inventories, evaluation logs, approval decisions)\n"
"- Purchasing commercial products, SDKs, or middleware containing embedded OSS for product integration:\n"
"  - Confirm whether procured deliverables contain OSS (subject to OSS disclosure requests)\n"
"  - -> [Procuring OSS from Suppliers](./using/supplier-procurement.md)"
msgstr ""
"- 自社開発\n"
"- サプライヤーからの納品\n"
"- 委託・共同開発では、契約段階でOSSの取り決め（OSSリスト提出、SBOM、是正対応等）\n"
"- 利用しているOSSの情報（一覧・評価結果・判断結果）の記録\n"
"- 他社製品／SDK／ミドルウェア等を購入して自社製品に組み込み販売する場合\n"
"  - 調達品にOSSが含まれないか確認（OSS情報提出・確認の対象）\n"
"  - → [サプライヤーからのOSS入手手順](./using/supplier-procurement.md)"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:18
msgid "## Pre-Release Verification"
msgstr "## 出荷・提供前に確認する"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:19
msgid ""
"- License compliance checks\n"
"- Notice artifact inclusion (LICENSE / NOTICE files)\n"
"- Finalizing release deliverables\n"
"- Logging OSS inventories, evaluation logs, and approval records for release builds\n"
"- Source code disclosure and modification notices where required\n"
"- Incident protocols for suspected license violations, data leaks, or security bugs\n"
"- Ensuring deliverable authenticity and provenance (code signing, SBOMs, provenance attestations)\n"
"- Contractual term verification\n"
"  - (e.g., verifying consistency between EULA/contract terms and OSS license terms; ensuring user rights under LGPL are preserved; confirming OSS license terms override conflicting proprietary restrictions)"
msgstr ""
"- ライセンス遵守\n"
"- 添付物（LICENSE / NOTICE）\n"
"- 成果物の確定\n"
"- 出荷物に含まれるOSS一覧、評価結果・判断結果の記録\n"
"- 必要に応じたソース提供・改変明示\n"
"- ライセンス違反・情報漏えい・脆弱性などの疑いがある場合\n"
"- 成果物の真正性・来歴を担保する（署名、SBOM、プロビナンス等）\n"
"- 契約条件の確認\n"
"  - （例：EULA/契約上の制限とOSS条件の整合、LGPL等で必要となり得る利用者側の権利確保、OSSライセンス条項の優先適用が妨げられないことの確認）"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:20
msgid "## Post-Release Operations (Maintenance & Support)"
msgstr "## 出荷後（運用・保守で対応する）"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:21
msgid ""
"- Fulfilling source code requests (intake channels, fulfillment procedures, source bundle packaging)\n"
"- Vulnerability and bug management (impact analysis -> mitigation/patching -> customer notifications -> post-mortems)\n"
"- Remediating post-release OSS discoveries or license issues (over-the-air updates, advisories)\n"
"- Continuous dependency and SBOM maintenance"
msgstr ""
"- ソースコード提供要求への対応（要求受付窓口、提供手順、提供物の範囲）\n"
"- 脆弱性・バグ対応（影響評価→修正/回避→周知→再発防止の流れ）\n"
"- 出荷後に判明したOSS混入・ライセンス問題の是正（必要に応じてアップデートや通知）\n"
"- 依存関係更新／SBOM更新などの継続的メンテナンス"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:22
msgid "## Troubleshooting & Consultations"
msgstr "## 困ったら調べる・相談する"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:23
msgid ""
"- [OSS Usage FAQ](./using/usage-faq.md)\n"
"- [License FAQ](./compliance/license-faq.md)\n"
"- [Glossary](./about/glossary.md)\n"
"- [What Is an OSPO?](./about/ospo.md)\n"
"- Consulting on upstream contributions or CLA executions"
msgstr ""
"- [OSS利用FAQ](./using/usage-faq.md)\n"
"- [ライセンスFAQ](./compliance/license-faq.md)\n"
"- [用語集](./about/glossary.md)\n"
"- [OSPOとは](./about/ospo.md)\n"
"- 外部OSSへのコントリビューションやCLA署名が関わる場合"

#. type: 標題
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:24
msgid "## Releasing Open Source Software"
msgstr "## OSSを公開する手順"

#. type: 清單
#: operation-templates/how-to-use-guide-for-users.md:25
msgid ""
"- Release applications / verification checklists / official repositories / change management:\n"
"  - -> Releasing Open Source Software *(Work in Progress as of April 2026)*"
msgstr ""
"- 公開申請／確認事項／公式リポジトリ／変更管理\n"
